// Title: Restricted Software Access By SRP
// ID: b4c8da4a-1c12-46b0-8a2b-0a8521d03442
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2023-01-12
// Tags: attack.lateral-movement, attack.execution, attack.t1072
// Description: Detects restricted access to applications by the Software Restriction Policies (SRP) policy
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(where(Provider_Name = "Microsoft-Windows-SoftwareRestrictionPolicies") AND (where(EventID = "865") OR where(EventID = "866") OR where(EventID = "867") OR where(EventID = "868") OR where(EventID = "882")))
